    "show_share": true,
    "description": "When he arrived at the Aga Khan University Hospital (AKUH) in Karachi, 28-year-old Arifullah was unable to work or care for his children due to a heart condition he had been living with since birth. An operation at another hospital had failed to help him, but a successful surgery at AKUH restored him to health, and he now supports his family as a rickshaw driver.",
